  "text": "Stereotactic Radiation Therapy | The Oncology Service\nHours & Contact\nTOS - Leesburg\n(571) 209-1176\nleesburg@tosvets.com\nTOS - Richmond\n(804) 999-0001\nrichmond@tosvets.com\nTOS - Springfield\n(703) 451-8900, option 2\nspringfield@tosvets.com\nfacebook\ninstagram\nMenu\nServices\nMedical Oncology\nRadiation Oncology\nDiagnostic Imaging\nStereotactic Radiation Therapy\nOutpatient Imaging\nElectrochemotherapy\nAbout Us\nMeet the Team\nVeterinarians\nTOS Leesburg - Veterinarians\nTOS Richmond - Veterinarians\nTOS Springfield - Veterinarians\nSupport Staff\nTOS Leesburg - Support Staff\nTOS Richmond - Support Staff\nTOS Springfield - Support Staff\nYour First Visit\nWhen Your Pet is a Patient\nPayment Options\nClinical Studies\nCareers\nLeesburg\nRichmond\nSpringfield\nTestimonials\nResources\nForms\nLeesburg Forms\nRichmond Forms\nSpringfield Forms\nFAQs\nPet Chemotherapy Guide\nDiscounts\nGrief Resources\nNutrition For The Canine Oncology Patient\nNutrition For The Feline Oncology Patient\nPet Emergency & Urgent Care Resources\nEvents\nPet Loss Support Group\nPet Cancer Support Group\nBlog\nCats\nDogs\nOther\nLocations\nLeesburg\nLeesburg Referral Form\nLeesburg DVM Referring Form\nRichmond\nSpringfield\nRequest an Appointment\nSearch\nButton Bar\nClient Portal\nrVetLink Portal\nReferral Forms\nStereotactic Radiation Therapy\nThere Is More Than One Way to Fight Cancer\nJust as in human medicine, some forms of cancer respond best to radiation therapy. We offer conventional definitive and palliative radiation therapy, as well as Stereotactic Radiation Therapy (SRT). Stereotactic Radiation Therapy is typically completed in 1-4 treatments within a single week, instead of the standard 15-18 treatments given over 3 weeks needed for conventional radiation therapy.\nStereotactic Radiation Therapy is most effective for the treatment of tumors that are difficult to reach with surgery alone. This level of precision requires specialized equipment for treatment and image guidance, as well as highly accurate patient positioning and immobilization devices.\nBenefits of Stereotactic Radiation\nNon-invasive painless procedure\nFewer treatments, shorter treatment time\nGreater treatment accuracy\nImproved sparing of normal tissues (fewer side effects)\nImproved outcomes for certain tumor types\nStereotactic Radiation Therapy is offered at our\nLeesburg, Virginia\nand\nRichmond, Virginia\nlocations.\nHow Are We Doing?\nreview us!\nOffered At\nThe Oncology Service - Leesburg\nThe Oncology Service - Richmond\nServices\nMedical Oncology\nRadiation Oncology\nDiagnostic Imaging\nStereotactic Radiation Therapy\nElectrochemotherapy\nOutpatient Imaging\nShare this content\ntwitter\nemail\npinterest\nfacebook\nVisit our office to get the latest in top-quality veterinary care along with unparalleled service\nLinks\nAbout Us\nServices\nResources\nContact Us\nPrivacy Policy\nAccessibility\nLogin / Account\nGet In Touch\nTOS - Leesburg\n(571) 209-1176\nleesburg@tosvets.com\nTOS - Richmond\n(804) 999-0001\nrichmond@tosvets.com\nTOS - Springfield\n(703) 451-8900, option 2\nspringfield@tosvets.com\nHow Are We Doing?\nReview Us\nfacebook\ninstagram\nX\nThe Oncology Service - Springfield\nThe Oncology Service - Richmond\nThe Oncology Service - Leesburg\n©2025 The Oncology Service. Resource Articles ©2025 KARMAjack. All Rights Reserved.\nVeterinary websites by KARMAjack\nNotice\nTemporary Closure Notice\nOur hospital will be closed from\nSeptember 8–12\nfor unexpected facility repairs.\nWe’re working quickly to get everything resolved. In the meantime, our team will be monitoring our email and voicemail remotely.\nThank you for your patience and understanding, we can’t wait to welcome you and your pets back soon!\nSee other locations\nDismiss",
